**Title:** Whispers of the Shore: A Journey with Kai

**Description:** Drift into a serene night with Kai, an imaginative eleven-year-old boy, as he walks along a tranquil coastal shoreline. Accompanied by Ripple, a curious sea otter, Kai embarks on a reflective journey under a starlit sky, where the gentle waves and whispering winds teach the virtues of patience and acceptance. This calming narrative, crafted to ease anxiety and encourage emotional calm, wraps listeners in the soothing embrace of nature’s lullaby, inviting restful sleep and peaceful dreams.

